    {
      "text": "those who do good will be saved, D&C 6:13. fear not to do good, D&C 6:33. trust in that Spirit which leads to do good, D&C 11:12. the Lord will cause heavens to shake for Saints’ good, D&C 21:6 (35:24). none do good except few, D&C 33:4 (35:12). if men do good, they shall not lose their reward, D&C 58:28. good things of earth given for use and benefit of man, D&C 59:17–18. obedient shall eat good of land, D&C 64:34. they who have done good will come forth in resurrection of just, D&C 76:17. doing good to fellow beings promotes glory of the Lord, D&C 81:4. all things shall work together for your good, D&C 90:24 (100:15; 105:40; 122:7). every tree that brings not forth good fruit will be hewn down, D&C 97:7. uphold wise and good men, D&C 98:10. cleave unto good, D&C 98:11. afflictions shall be for thy good, D&C 122:7.",
